Digital Prioris HX 5100MP SMP Systems

Highlights

*  Flexible symmetric multiprocessing to meet the demands of any IS manager
*  Designed for expansion and performance
*  Pentium 100 MHz performance in 1, 2, or 4 processor models--all in the
   same enclosure

Product description

The Prioris HX 5100MP Intel Pentium based symmetric multiprocessing (SMP)
systems provide the computing power, fault tolerant features, and investment
protection demanded by IS managers. The Prioris HX 5100MP platform is based
on Intel's 100 MHz Pentium processor and complements the Prioris HX 590 and
HX 590DP systems currently shipping.

Prioris HX 5100MP configurations

Prioris HX 5100MP   One 100MHz Pentium processor
Prioris HX 5100MP/2 Two 100MHz Pentium processors
Prioris HX 5100MP/4 Four 100MHz Pentium processors

These models include either a 2-channel 2940W SCSI controller or 2-channel
PCI RAID, plus a variety of SCSI hard drive configurations.

