Benefits

*  Flexibility--Up to 1 GB of standard ECC system memory provides
   flexibility for new applications and emerging technologies
*  Investment protection--"PowerGrade" upgrades available to protect users'
   storage and memory investments
*  System performance--512 KB of secondary write-back burst cache per
   processor enhances system performance for processor intensive application
   environments
*  Support--Three year on-site warranty with next business day response
*  Expansion--"PowerSphere" expandable architecture provides internal
   support for a second current-sharing 450W power supply and redundant
   cooling subsystem with failover protection for processor(s), option
   cards, and hard drives

Product positioning

Digital's Prioris HX 5100MP models complement the Prioris HX PC server
family. The Prioris HX 5100MP is positioned above the HX 590 and HX 590DP
systems in price and performance. Although the Prioris HX 5100MP shares the
same chassis as the Prioris HX 590 and Prioris 590DP, there are many
performance features that differentiate the two product lines.

