Services

The Prioris HX family includes a three year on-site warranty with next
business day response. This warranty is one of the most comprehensive in the
industry and includes product lifetime toll-free technical assistance,
Digital Bulletin Board Service, and Digital's automated fax back service.

Technical data

The Prioris HX 5100MP includes the following features:

*  Compliance with Intel's MPS 1.1 specification, which ensures SMP
   operating system compatibility
*  PCI bridge technology with five full bus master PCI slots, plus four EISA
   slots plus one PCI/EISA shared slot that can scale as processors and
   memory increase
*  128-bit memory bus keeps pace with the fast 100 MHz Pentium processors
*  Up to 1 GB of ECC system memory provides expansion for new applications
   and emerging technologies
*  Seven hot swap drive bays with dual-segment SCSI backplane for disk
   redundancy standard and support for RAID levels 0, 1, and 5
*  Support of the existing SCSI hard drives in Storage Building Blocks
   (SBBs), plus the recently announced 7200 RPM hard drives
*  Support for Digital's Remote Server Manager, with out-of-band server
   support via modem connections
*  Tested compatible operating environments:
     - Windows NT Server 3.50
     - Windows NT Workstation 3.5
     - Windows for Workgroups 3.11
     - Windows 3.0 and 3.1
     - IBM OS/2 2.1 and 3.1
     - IBM OS/2 SMP
     - SCO UNIX 3.2.4 (MPX license support)
     - SCO ODT 3.2.4
     - Novell NetWare 386 3.11 and 4.0
     - Novell UnixWare 2.0
     - Digital PATHWORKS V5.1
     - Banyan Vines
     - MS-DOS 5.0 and 6.22
*  Rackmountable (see related article in this issue)

PowerGrade Upgrade Path

