hardware and software, as well as ongoing support.

Technical data

The RW525  requires the following versions of Optical Storage Management
Software:

*  With OpenVMS VAX operating system --  Optical Storage Management Software
   for OpenVMS V3.3
*  With OpenVMS Alpha operating system --  Optical Storage Management
   Software for OpenVMS V3.2
*  With Digital UNIX ( formerly called DEC OSF/1) operating system --
   Optical Storage Management Software for Digital UNIX V1.4

The RW525 requires two consecutive SCSI ports on the same bus, one for the
drive and one for the mechanical autochanger.

For more information, please refer to the appropriate SPD for Optical
Storage Management Software or POLYCENTER Hierarchical Storage Management
software or the local storage specialist supporting optical storage
products.

