Product description

The DEClaser 3500 provides a cost effective robust printing solution for
small workgroups that use ANSI, PostScript, or PCL applications.

With a print speed of 12 pages per minute, the DEClaser 3500 is the most
versatile printer available. It offers support for more business-class
features than any other printer. Laser technology with true 600 dpi
resolution, combined with resolution enhancement, produces stunning, crisp,
clean output with smooth graduations and sharp black text.

The DEClaser 3500 is an ideal printing solution for networked offices.
Interface cards provide compatibility with PC, Macintosh, UNIX, Digital, and
other popular networking topologies. All interfaces are simultaneously
active, making it easy for Macintosh users to share the printer with PC and
workstation users.

Presentation quality output is produced and application compatibility is
preserved as the DEClaser 3500 ships with ANSI, Adobe PostScript Level 2,
and HP-PCL5 in the box.

The DEClaser 3500 printer switches automatically and reliably between the
printer languages without users ever knowing--enabling high productivity.The
DEClaser 3500 is a flexible multifunction device, capable of sending and
receiving faxes. Its fax capability allows for the electronic delivery of
faxes on plain paper, preserving resolution and eliminating the need for fax
servers and PCMCIA cards.

For more information, see the "DEClaser 3500 -- The Perfect Laser Printer
for Small Workgroups" article in the December 1994 issue of Customer Update.

Benefits

