15C Monitor for Digital PC Systems

The 15C monitor is a 15-inch (14-inch viewable) Plug and Play flat square
screen monitor with a .28 mm dot pitch that is an excellent high resolution
monitor for the Microsoft Windows user with limited deskspace. The Digital
15C monitor displays crisp, vibrant images at resolutions up to 1024 x 768
pixels at 70Hz non-interlaced and lower resolutions of refresh rates up to
90 Hz. The 15C increases the viewing area over 14-inch monitors by almost 25
percent at a very affordable price.  The microprocessor - based OSD
(On-Screen-Display) controls allow the user to easily modify and store a
variety of image adjustments. The 15C has a 32-mode memory, of which 7 are
factory preset to the most popular display settings.

This monitor is certified to meet the Energy Star requirements and utilizes
the VESA DPMS (Display Power Management Signaling) standard to lower the
cost of ownership. This monitor, like all of Digital's color monitors,
complies with the MPR-II Swedish standards, ensuring low radiation for
safety and comfort.

The new monitor replaces the FR-PCXBV-PC and is currently available
exclusively in the Northern Hemisphere variant. All Digital PC systems are
compatible with this new monitor.

