             Use License

Other available POLYCENTER performance products include POLYCENTER
Performance Data Collector and Performance Advisor V2.1 (SPD 36.02, 36.03)
for both OpenVMS VAX and OpenVMS Alpha, and POLYCENTER Performance Data
Collector and Monitor V1.4 for Digital UNIX (SPD 46.97).  Note that the
Monitor and its Collector can coexist on the same system(s) with the Advisor
and its Collector.

