POLYCENTER Save Set Manager V1.1 for OpenVMS

Highlights

*    Support for OpenVMS Alpha V6.1 and V6.2 and OpenVMS VAX V6.2

Product description

The POLYCENTER Save Set Manager for OpenVMS systems is a layered software
product that can significantly reduce OpenVMS backup operational time,
improving system management operations and increasing system availability.
POLYCENTER Save Set Manager V1.1 extends these benefits to users requiring
OpenVMS Alpha V6.1 and 6.2, and OpenVMS VAX V6.2 support.

There are three separate and distinct functions in V1.1:

*  The Save Set VALIDATE function verifies the internal consistency of a
   specified save set offline and reports any exceptions back to the user.
   Users who currently use the /VERIFY option with BACKUP can perform those
   verifications offline, outside of critical backup window.

*  The Save Set COPY function provides the ability to duplicate a specified
   save set with the addition/deletion of CRC or XOR blocks in the output
   save set, enabling users to create multiple copies of BACKUP save sets
   (for example, one nearline copy and one offline copy for fire storage)
   without having to run BACKUP multiple times. The COPY facility also
   allows users to relocate save sets from older tapes or tape technologies
   to newer ones.

*  The Save Set MERGE can reduce the number and frequency of full BACKUP
   operations, potentially shortening the backup window by up to 50 percent.
   Full backups, performed within the critical backup window, can be
   replaced through incremental backups, which are the merged with other
   incremental and full backups outside of the backup window. This
   capability also reduces the number of incremental save sets required to
   restore a full volume.

For more information, see the "POLYCENTER Save Set Manager V1.0 for OpenVMS
VAX" article in the November 1994 issue of Customer Update.

Benefits

*  Improves operator and system manager productivity by reducing the amount
   of time spent on online backup and restores.

*  Facilitates migration from older, slower, and more expensive tape
   technologies to newer, faster, less expensive, and more reliable tape
   technology.

*  Supports off-site archiving with copying of BACKUP save sets.

*  Reduces down time for a BACKUP/RESTORE operation through MERGE
   capabilities.

*  Helps improve the ability to recover critical data in archived save sets
   with Save Set VALIDATE.

Availability and ordering

POLYCENTER Save Set Manager for OpenVMS systems is available now through
Digital, its distributors, and the DECdirect ordering and Electronic Store
services.  Basic or DECservice maintenance agreements and Media
Documentation and Distribution Service recommended.

