operating system for all AlphaStation systems, and the product is factory
installed on pre-packaged systems.

For users adding audio and video capabilities to Digital UNIX or OpenVMS
applications, order the Multimedia Services development license for Digital
UNIX or OpenVMS. A Digital Light & Sound Pack utilizes the Video for Windows
API in Windows NT. Users can add audio and video capabilities to
applications without ordering additional products.

Multimedia Services for Digital UNIX and OpenVMS are distributed on the
