Reliable Transaction Router V3.1 for Sun

HIGHLIGHTS

*  Available for Sun client and router/server systems
*  Supports a mix of nodes, including Digital UNIX, Sun, and OpenVMS
   platforms
*  Supports TCP/IP and DECnet communications

PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

This release extends the features of the Reliable Transaction Router to the
Sun platform. Reliable Transaction Router is a layered software product that
supports continuous availability for those critical client/server
applications where downtime impacts profitability or customer satisfaction.

Reliable Transaction Router is particularly suited for users with multiple
locations seeking to:

*  Integrate distributed business functions
*  Implement client/server technology
*  Downsize mainframe applications
*  Ensure continuous availability

Reliable Transaction Router provides low risk, open technology that is
adaptable to changing business needs.  Typical applications include trading
and settlement, reservation systems, HMO service providers, and distributed
just-in-time (JIT) inventory systems.

Reliable Transaction Router can be utilized on a variety of clients,
including MS-Windows and MS-DOS PCs, as well as Digital UNIX (formerly
called DEC OSF/1), OpenVMS, and Sun workstations. Router/server capability
is available on Digital UNIX, OpenVMS VAX, OpenVMS Alpha, and Sun platforms.

BENEFITS

Continuous system availability enables users to avoid disruptions to
business operations that result in revenue losses or customer
dissatisfaction. Scalability allows users to grow their Reliable Transaction
Router client/server network by integrating new applications as business
needs change. This product also provides transaction and data shadowing for
a higher level of failover transparency. Investment protection is provided
through interoperability with Reliable Transaction Router across Digital
UNIX, OpenVMS, and Sun systems, heterogeneous client support, presentation
service, and database independence.

AVAILABILITY AND ORDERING

Reliable Transaction Router V3.1 for Sun is available now. There are two
licenses available. A "Front End License" supports client functionality. A
"Back End License" supports client, router, and server functionality, and is
required for router or server systems.

Layered Product Support services are also available for Reliable Transaction
Router V3.1. The software is usually sold in mission-critical projects that
require consulting services. Digital consulting services are available and
can be supplemented with product-specific consulting from the Reliable
Transaction Router engineering group on an as-needed basis.

