HUBwatch V3.1 for Sun

HIGHLIGHTS

*  Allows users of SunNet Manager, HP OpenView for Sun, and Sun OS to
   graphically manage Digital networking products
*  Provides same full function, graphical, SNMP management of
   GIGAswitch/FDDI and the DEChub family on a Sun SPARCstation as on other
   platforms
*  Lowest cost Sun based management solution on the market

PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

HUBwatch V3.1 for Sun enables users of SunNet Manager, HP OpenView for Sun,
and SunOS to manage Digital's industry leading DEChub and GIGAswitch/FDDI
network technology through the powerful, yet easy to use, HUBwatch graphical
interface. With HUBwatch V3.1 for Sun, users managing their SynOptics,
Cabletron, Cisco, or 3Com network devices with SunNet Manager or HP OpenView
for Sun can easily integrate their Digital networking devices into the
existing network management structure. This is part of Digital's ongoing
commitment to provide the same network management interface from all common
platforms.

HUBwatch is element network management software that provides a powerful,
low cost, graphical, Simple Network Management Protocol (SNMP) interface to
control Digital's networking hardware. It lets users create virtual LANs in
a DEChub 900 MultiSwitch by interconnecting ports, modules, and LAN segments
with a simple drag-and-drop operation. HUBwatch V3.1 for Sun has the same
functionality and interface on SunOS as it has on Windows, Digital UNIX
(formerly called DEC OSF/1), and OpenVMS platforms. It can run standalone or
launched by common workgroup/enterprise managers.

BENEFITS

*  Investment protection--Sun SPARCstation users can manage the DEChub
   family and GIGAswitch/FDDI using their existing equipment and software
   with no additional training or setup required for their enterprise
   management software.
*  Increased functionality--Digital's industry leading DEChub and
   GIGAswitch/FDDI technology can now be integrated into a Sun based network
   management structure without expending substantial money for a new
   management system.

AVAILABILITY AND ORDERING

