TECHNICAL DATA

Software requirements

*  Multimedia Services is required and provides the runtime and application
   programming interface to support the FullVideo Supreme, FullVideo Supreme
   JPEG, and built-in audio on AlphaStation systems. The interface will be
   extended as needed to support new hardware features in these and future
   multimedia products. Multimedia Services runtime license is included with
   all workstation packages as well as Factory Installed.

*  Multimedia Services Development Software includes an API, sample
   applications and programmer's manual.

*  Digital Light & Sound Pack for Windows NT is required for support of the
   FullVideo Supreme and FullVideo Supreme JPEG.

*  At a minimum, Digital UNIX V3.0 is required for Multimedia Services V1.6
   for Digital UNIX. (Refer to the "Multimedia Services for AlphaStation
   Systems" article in this issue for a full description on the newest
   features and types of software compression and decompression supported.)

*  The FullVideo Basic option includes the necessary Windows NT driver, ATI
   TV, and MEDIACAPTURE applications via 3.5 inch floppy.

